Package: Rwapor
Title: Download WaPOR and AgERA5 Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("First", "Last", email = "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads and processes WaPOR and AgERA5 raster data, extracting time series and calculating zonal statistics for regions and polygons. Supports unit conversion and dynamic metadata fetching.
